        "title": "The plans below show how the ground of a particular building has changed over time. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em><strong>The plans below show how the ground of a particular building has changed over time. </strong></em></span><em style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features.</strong></em></div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Ground Floor Changes of a Building</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">\n<div>\n<p>Đề b&agrave;i Ground Floor Changes of a Building y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về sự biến đổi về bố cục của tầng trệt một t&ograve;a nh&agrave; qua ba giai đoạn kh&aacute;c nha từ năm 1958 đến ng&agrave;y nay.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-KGfkdvXnMo9tBVxWubvlf0gagVh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TOoQd6oJTo25Hhxi84tlE4FPgnb\"><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Ground Floor Changes of a Building với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: sự biến đổi của một t&ograve;a nh&agrave; - từ năm 1958 đến ng&agrave;y nay</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TOoQd6oJTo25Hhxi84tlE4FPgnb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-URUgdOFlfoTLuOx4fhol6qV1gQ3\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề map, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ tập trung n&oacute;i về c&aacute;c sự thay đổi ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-URUgdOFlfoTLuOx4fhol6qV1gQ3\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GlSYdEylHoUmtOxJ8lilUVvqgph\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>t&ograve;a nh&agrave; đ&atilde; trải qua những chuyển đổi ho&agrave;n to&agrave;n về chức năng, từ một <strong>kh&ocirc;ng gian văn ph&ograve;ng </strong><em>(office space)</em> th&agrave;nh <strong>khu căn hộ để ở</strong> <em>(residential accommodation)</em>, v&agrave; cuối c&ugrave;ng l&agrave; cửa h&agrave;ng hoa thương mại, với <strong>nhiều thay đổi</strong><em> (modifications)</em> đ&aacute;ng kể về bố tr&iacute; b&ecirc;n trong v&agrave; mục đ&iacute;ch sử dụng c&aacute;c ph&ograve;ng trong suốt c&aacute;c giai đoạn.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(230, 126, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch m&ocirc; tả c&aacute;c đặc điểm khu vực dựa tr&ecirc;n t&igrave;nh trạng (cũ v&agrave; mới)</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CpWhdSGJFoye2PxbbFelCRADg5e\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BgHSd2dTeomakhx6OoxlhVwogvg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OnXIdHDi9oq6Lpx1Mxtl2glPgud\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> T&ograve;a nh&agrave; thay đổi từ văn ph&ograve;ng th&agrave;nh khu vực nh&agrave; ở </strong><em>(the apartment period)</em></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JfSEd5jhaohx83xcRIVlry7HgZL\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CFf5dpJxfoY5GpxreFZlQgTegge\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>khu bếp được <strong>giữ nguy&ecirc;n vị tr&iacute; ban đầu </strong><em>(was retained in its original position)</em>. Văn ph&ograve;ng của quản l&yacute; v&agrave; khu lễ t&acirc;n được <strong>cải tạo để tạo th&agrave;nh</strong> <em>(reconfigured to accommodate)</em> hai ph&ograve;ng ngủ ri&ecirc;ng biệt.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OEzEdQ4SLoxoNXxEkBCl3CIHggh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>ph&ograve;ng họp v&agrave; văn ph&ograve;ng trợ l&yacute; được hợp nhất v&agrave; chuyển đổi th&agrave;nh một ph&ograve;ng kh&aacute;ch rộng r&atilde;i.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SQl4dEcN6o5VZBxzgXRlqLYMgsc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>văn ph&ograve;ng thư k&yacute; v&agrave; nh&agrave; vệ sinh được <strong>gộp lại v&agrave; cải tạo th&agrave;nh</strong> <em>(combined and converted into)</em> khu vực ph&ograve;ng tắm v&agrave; v&ograve;i sen, tạo n&ecirc;n một <strong>kh&ocirc;ng gian sinh hoạt tiện nghi hơn</strong> <em>(more functional residential layout).</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<br>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P28wdkqCxoxJzCxhGfIlLa1cgwd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\"><strong>BODY</strong></span><strong>&nbsp;2</strong><strong>: C&aacute;c ph&aacute;t triển mới biến căn hộ th&agrave;nh nơi kinh doanh hoa </strong><em>(the flower shop era)</em></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P28wdkqCxoxJzCxhGfIlLa1cgwd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo&nbsp;<strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V6IFdwn3VokBZMx6vKHljTghgPh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>khu bếp vẫn giữ nguy&ecirc;n, <strong>cho thấy sự tiện dụng </strong><em>(consistent utility)</em><strong> nhất qu&aacute;n qua cả ba giai đoạn</strong> <em>(across all three phases).</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BcrmdGLHko0HXtxGFQBla2gWgtf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>ph&ograve;ng kh&aacute;ch v&agrave; ph&ograve;ng tắm đ&atilde; bị dỡ bỏ để thay thế bằng <strong>khu vực thiệp qu&agrave; tặng v&agrave; khu vui chơi</strong> <em>(designated areas for gift cards and a play area)</em>, với một khu trưng b&agrave;y hoa<strong> nằm giữa</strong> <em>(positioned between)</em> hai khu vực n&agrave;y.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EVpZdTxnQocGYixdOTulSFgigdh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">hai ph&ograve;ng ngủ được thay thế ho&agrave;n to&agrave;n bằng một văn ph&ograve;ng l&agrave;m việc v&agrave; th&ecirc;m một <em><strong>khu trưng b&agrave;y hoa</strong></em><em> (flower display area)</em>, hiệu quả chuyển đổi kh&ocirc;ng gian ở th&agrave;nh <strong>m&ocirc;i trường kinh doanh b&aacute;n lẻ hoa</strong> <em>(a commercial flower retail environment.).</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 1792,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SJ6NdjuFAogWfgxr32gltZXRgwb\">The maps illustrate the layout changes of a building's ground floor across three distinct time periods: 1958-1984, 1985-2000, and 2001 to the present.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18391,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1793,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MlWMd5AdIoEx9nxM677lRm8ngGd\">Overall, the building underwent complete functional transformations, evolving from an office space to residential accommodation, and finally to a commercial flower shop, with significant modifications to the internal layout and room purposes throughout the periods.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18391,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1794,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DKNhdPi21om3KExdBQVl0liWgBc\">During the first transformation from the office period (1958-1984) to the apartment period (1985-2000), the kitchen was retained in its original position. The original manager's office and reception area were reconfigured to accommodate two separate bedrooms. Additionally, the meeting room and assistant's office were combined and converted into a spacious living room. Finally, the secretary's office and toilet were merged and transformed into a bathroom and shower area, creating a more functional residential layout.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18391,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1795,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ItkndbX06oMSqOxBNVMlMLNXgxe\">In the subsequent period from the apartment phase (1985-2000) to the flower shop era (2001-present), the kitchen remained unchanged, demonstrating its consistent utility across all three phases. However, the living room and bathroom were demolished and replaced by designated areas for gift cards and a play area, with a flower display section positioned between these two spaces. Meanwhile, the two bedrooms were completely replaced by an office and additional flower display area, effectively converting the residential space into a commercial flower retail environment.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18391,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
        ],
